BUILDING ON IT (this is what it is for)
  You may publish your own mods - free or paid-for-nothing, under any license you like for YOUR files -
  that USE Accessory Slots:
  - add, change or remove slots from your own Config/accessoryslots.xml;
  - make items that go in its slots (the AccessorySlot item property);
  - reference AccessorySlots.dll from your own code and call its public API.
  Tell your users to install Accessory Slots from its official page. Do not bundle a copy of it inside
  your mod's download.

